<title>USA: Strouds May same-store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Strouds May same-store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc said Thursday it had net sales of $15.8 million for the four weeks ended May 31, compared with $14.7 million a year earlier. Comparable-store sales were down 7.3 percent.</p>
<p>Net sales for the 13 weeks ended May 31 were $50.5 million, compared with $46.4 million a year earlier. comparable-store sales fell 5.0 percent.</p>
